sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant N as Node.js HTTP API
    participant P as PostgreSQL
    participant W as Website dich
    Note over C,W: Vi du thiet ke; chua phai ket qua chay that
    C->>N: POST /shorten (URL)
    N->>P: INSERT code va URL
    P-->>N: Ghi thanh cong
    N-->>C: 201 JSON (code, shortUrl)
    C->>N: GET /r/code
    N->>P: SELECT URL theo code
    P-->>N: URL hoac khong co hang
    alt Tim thay code
        N-->>C: 302 Location
        C->>W: GET URL dich
        W-->>C: Response cua website dich
    else Khong tim thay code
        N-->>C: 404 JSON; khong co Location
    end
